<title>SPAIN: Santander launches two new guaranteed funds.</title>
<headline>Santander launches two new guaranteed funds.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank Santander said on Thursday it was launching two new investment funds: Santander Latinoamerica Asegurado F.I.M. and Santander SP Asegurado F.I.M.</p>
<p>The Latinoamerica fund allows investors to obtain 85 percent of the average rise of a basket of 20 Latin America shares over the next 5-1/2 years, Santander said.</p>
<p>SP fund guarantees 80 percent of the average index movement in the U.S. Standard &amp; Poor's 500.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
